{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "56f25297407fd147168aa2cb7822b801be883a05871146a0f9e7f18390e27e14", "ja": "（しまった、子ども扱いするのはまずかったかな？\nでも、そう感じたのは事実だし……）", "zh": "（糟糕，我是不是不该把她当孩子看待？\n不过，那确实是我的真实感受……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "59208e1cd96e346e5ae2452e54d473cc5d869830d86a34ea51d2412b1fd700ec", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、よくわかったね！　今日の撮影で、\n桃子が一番がんばったのがそこなんだよ。", "zh": "大哥哥，你看出来了啊！今天的拍摄，\n桃子最下功夫的就是这点喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "da96c99ae0f2975798bb3b44c4600941fa70ba2db39a1c1104c7c358a16f6c73", "ja": "大人の女性に憧れる女の子っていうのが、\n今回のテーマだったからね！", "zh": "毕竟这次的主题，\n就是向往成为成熟女人的小女生嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "72e4889198672244034060977dc66fe8b76fd15795ec696615a73f64e6f9105d", "ja": "お兄ちゃんに伝わったなら、バッチリだね。\nふふん♪", "zh": "大哥哥有感受到的话，那就完美了。\n哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3dcb344a9f417a4da54efbe49b2e3e53bfd1392eb4a18fc832741af8d5e6dc2e", "ja": "ああ、うん。よく伝わってきたよ。\nさすが、桃子だな。", "zh": "没错，嗯，我确实感受到了。\n桃子果然厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "01c5822468653c3379344d20aa44216c0a5bcdda82aefe3e0295a92ca0d1e77a", "ja": "トーゼンだよ。大事なのは、求められていることを\n理解して、応えること。それがプロなんだよ！", "zh": "那当然，关键在于理解并回应别人的期待，\n这才是专业人士该有的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e2a16e14931156e6592071cb0504df730248586102727189027618fc5a6e8666", "ja": "桃子のプロ意識はすごいな……。\nこのCMは、きっと評判になるよ。", "zh": "桃子的敬业精神真的让人佩服……\n这支广告肯定会大受好评的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c12ee6e649d599f9bacc080dab2bff8d29bc94449cee9ee3eaef062e1ca82c70", "ja": "それにこのシャンプー、香りがすごくいいし。\nCMと相乗効果で、人気商品になりそうだな。", "zh": "而且这款洗发精非常好闻，\n配合广告应该会有加分效果，继而变成畅销商品呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "55faf6e840ce046bd9698a3e48a0cc987f2d44427bca4725211b27788cb9ddb0", "ja": "……。\nお兄ちゃん、このシャンプーの香り、好きなんだ？", "zh": "……\n大哥哥，原来你喜欢这款洗发精的味道啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1014_p", "source_sha256": "025d7555a14d742e306e28113857a92b674a6373d7c19618b052cd4fc264cfc4", "ja": "うん。\nすごくいい香りだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得这闻起来非常香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "cb7d535f1c89ff8b8fd1a59ef5f3f731d623cd7c0b963a8e0d95ca2dbd3bf720", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ……。", "zh": "哦，这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0093_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "a1b42d39df50ba1666c6136031bf2f55dd3062ca33a97b3d5660040f1ed1e207", "ja": "お兄ちゃん。さっきもらったシャンプー、\n忘れずに持って帰ってね。桃子が使うんだから！", "zh": "大哥哥，客户刚才送的洗发精，\n你要记得帮忙带回去喔，桃子要用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
